  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/7nr9m0q/Boosted-FPS.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"586\" height=\"78\"></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>基于 Fabric 的整合包，包含性能优化模组与设置调整，让你的《我的世界》运行更流畅、更高效！完全支持 Sodium（请阅读下方配置说明）。本整合包现已支持 1.16.5、1.17.1、1.18.2、1.19.4、1.20.6、1.21 以及 Fabric 26.1 版本。<br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>如需 Forge 版本请访问： <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-forge</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-size:24px\">如需 NeoForge 版本请访问： <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-neoforge</a></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>如需 Quilt 版本请访问： <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-quilt\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-quilt</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>如需 RPG 版本请访问： <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-rpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-rpg</a></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/LdG4vgH/Features.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"403\" height=\"64\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/675/498/2023-06-10_23.png\" width=\"1127\" height=\"634\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（得益于以下功能，你的原版游戏体验将得到进一步提升）</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">最新版本 - 畅玩搭载模组的最新游戏更新！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">帧率性能提升 - 得益于 Sodium 移植版及其他性能增强模组。本整合包已收录绝大多数 Fabric 平台的性能优化模组。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模组配置界面 - 在游戏主菜单中显示“模组”按钮，列出已安装的模组（也可在此处调整模组设置）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">额外生活便利（QoL）模组 - 让你的《我的世界》游玩体验更加舒适愉快。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Hypixel 服务器就绪 - 预置了 Hypixel 服务器，安装即可直接游玩！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>原版（无模组）帧率：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/mFgNnsD/vanilla-screenshot.jpg\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Boosted FPS 整合包帧率：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rMZBCHR/boosted-screenshot.jpg\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/P6pJTy8/Config.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"270\" height=\"86\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">渲染距离已设置为较低值（示例为 5），以最大化帧率。若需看到更远的地形，可将其调至 8 或更高。可在&nbsp;选项 / 视频设置 / 常规 / 渲染距离 中进行更改。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">帧率超出显示器刷新率或出现画面撕裂？请在&nbsp;选项 / 视频设置 / 常规 中开启垂直同步（VSync）。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在视频设置的着色器包（Shaders）选项中启用光影（若你的设备性能允许）。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FAv8Axl7GIo?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9mN4mjBuPXA?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/fYFU4QtCzEw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ge32Bcch5UY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pmiSOeedr3k?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3g58tPSTmpQ?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即租用服务器，与好友一同畅玩！点击 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a> 或下方横幅，并使用优惠码 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 享受 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
